  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-333626\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>The matrix of our system is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"508\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"4\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 2em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Notice that:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Since the only (repeated) eigenvalue of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"509\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"510\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and it's positive, we have a <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"511\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 4.473em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 4.473em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mtext>unstable</mtext></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> node. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"512\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is not diagonal and has a repeated eigenvalue, there is only one linearly independent eigenvector. So, we have a <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"513\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 5.469em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 5.469em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mtext>degenerate</mtext></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> node.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> The phase portrait of the system looks as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-9290910e2163f2ba79e2913a83ff00f9\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/9290910e2163f2ba79e2913a83ff00f9\"></div></div>",
